<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" itunes:timing="Word"><head xmlns=""><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation><text for="L4">仰望夜空</text><text for="L5">向烟花许下愿望</text><text for="L6">永远的 约定</text><text for="L7">在坡道上 穿过了正午的热浪</text><text for="L8">扳着手指</text><text for="L9">细数众多的笑脸</text><text for="L10">历历在目</text><text for="L11">静下心来听到的脚步</text><text for="L12">以及渐渐靠近的笑声</text><text for="L13">都向着回到蓝天的回忆里而去</text><text for="L14">那手牵着手的夏天</text><text for="L15">让我们定下的约定实现吧</text><text for="L16">在逐渐凋零的昨天</text><text for="L17">如果能描绘下去</text><text for="L18">再次绽放笑容吧</text><text for="L19">眼中映出的那些纸飞机也好</text><text for="L20">风儿翻动的那本画书也好</text><text for="L21">都和这个夏天一起 向着遥远的天空</text><text for="L22">向着吟唱的歌谣里</text><text for="L23">已经不能回头了</text><text for="L24">因为这双手已经变得温暖</text><text for="L25">向耀眼光芒中延伸的两个影子</text><text for="L26">光着脚慢慢走近</text><text for="L27">仰望的天空 朝远方无限延展</text><text for="L28">向着夏天的尽头</text><text for="L29">静下心来听到的脚步</text><text for="L30">以及渐渐靠近的笑声</text><text for="L31">都向着回到蓝天的回忆里而去</text><text for="L32">直到那手牵着手的夏天</text><text for="L33">现在早已</text><text for="L34">朝着那远方而去</text><text for="L35">抬头仰望夜空</text><text for="L36">用笑容向着烟花许愿</text></translation></translations><transliterations><transliteration><text for="L4">yo zo ra wo mi a ge te</text><text for="L5">ha na bi ni ne ga i go to</text><text for="L6">ya ku so ku zu tto</text><text for="L7">ma hi ru no ka ge ro u</text><text for="L8">ta ku sa n no e ga o</text><text for="L9">yu bi o ri ka zo e te ta</text><text for="L10">wa su re na i ma da</text><text for="L11">mi mi wo su ma se ba ki ko e ru a shi o to mo</text><text for="L12">ka ke yo ru a no wa ra i go e mo</text><text for="L13">a o i so ra e to ka e ru o mo i de no na ka e</text><text for="L14">fu ta tsu no te wo tsu na i da na tsu</text><text for="L15">e ga i ta ya ku so ku ka na e ru yo</text><text for="L16">ko bo re yu ku ki no u</text><text for="L17">ki za n de yu ke ru na ra</text><text for="L18">wa ra e ru yo ma ta</text><text for="L19">hi to mi ni u tsu ru a no ka mi hi ko u ki mo</text><text for="L20">ka ze ga me ku ru a no e ho n mo</text><text for="L21">to o i so ra e to to do ku u ta go e no na ka e</text><text for="L22">na tsu to to mo ni</text><text for="L23">mo u fu ri ka e ra na i yo</text><text for="L24">ko no te ni nu ku mo ri a ru ka ra</text><text for="L25">ma bu shi sa no na ka no bi ru fu ta tsu no ka ge</text><text for="L26">ha da shi no ma ma yo ri so tte ru</text><text for="L27">mi a ge ta so ra wa</text><text for="L28">na tsu no ha te e</text><text for="L29">mi mi wo su ma se ba ki ko e ru a shi o to mo</text><text for="L30">ka ke yo ru a no wa ra i go e mo</text><text for="L31">a o i so ra e to ka e ru o mo i de no na ka e</text><text for="L32">fu ta tsu no te wo tsu na i da na tsu ma de</text><text for="L33">i ma wa mo u</text><text for="L34">a no ha ru ka e</text><text for="L35">yo zo ra wo mi a ge te</text><text for="L36">ha na bi ni ne ga i to e ga o wo</text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夜奏花"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YURiKA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Summer Pockets Original SoundTrack"/></metadata></head><body xmlns="" dur="5:37.180"><div begin="0.000" end="5:37.180"><p begin="1.220" end="8.810" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.220" end="1.710">夜</span><span begin="1.710" end="2.770">空</span><span begin="2.770" end="5.470">を</span><span begin="5.470" end="5.780">見</span><span begin="5.780" end="6.480">上</span><span begin="6.480" end="8.710">げ</span><span begin="8.710" end="8.810">て</span></p><p begin="10.170" end="15.980" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.170" end=